<title>UK: DB Capital Markets sets warrants on the DAX index.</title>
<headline>DB Capital Markets sets warrants on the DAX index.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1997-02-11</dateline>
<text>
<p>DB Capital Markets GmbH has issued 30 million American-style put warrants, in three equal tranches, on the DAX index, lead manager Deutsche Morgan Grenfell said.</p>
<p> WARRANTS STRIKE	  ISS PRICE  PREMIUM   GEARING  MATURITY</p>
<p> PUT A    3,100.00 DEM  1.50 DEM   7.45 PCT  21.25 X  13.MAR.98</p>
<p> PUT B    3,100.00 DEM  1.67 DEM   7.98 PCT  19.09 X  19.JUN.98</p>
<p> PUT C    3,200.00 DEM  2.07 DEM   6.10 PCT  15.40 X  19.JUN.98</p>
<p> PAYDATE	12.FEB.97		   LISTING    FFT DDF</p>
<p> --Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
